  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 6138,
      "text": "Their reward with their Lord is Gardens of Eternity under which rivers flow, abiding therein forever. Allah is pleased with them and they are pleased with Him. This is for those who fear their Lord.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 98,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَيِّنَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Bayyina",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Evidence",
        "numberOfAyahs": 8,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 599,
      "ruku": 540,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6139,
      "text": "When the earth is shaken with a mighty quake,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 99,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزَّلۡزَلَةِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zalzala",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Earthquake",
        "numberOfAyahs": 8,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 599,
      "ruku": 541,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6140,
      "text": "and the earth throws out its burdens[1],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 99,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزَّلۡزَلَةِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zalzala",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Earthquake",
        "numberOfAyahs": 8,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 599,
      "ruku": 541,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6141,
      "text": "and man says[2], “What is the matter with it?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 99,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزَّلۡزَلَةِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zalzala",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Earthquake",
        "numberOfAyahs": 8,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 599,
      "ruku": 541,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6142,
      "text": "On that Day it will recount all its news,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 99,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزَّلۡزَلَةِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zalzala",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Earthquake",
        "numberOfAyahs": 8,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 599,
      "ruku": 541,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6143,
      "text": "because your Lord has inspired it [to do so].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 99,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزَّلۡزَلَةِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zalzala",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Earthquake",
        "numberOfAyahs": 8,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 599,
      "ruku": 541,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6144,
      "text": "On that Day all people will come forward in separate groups to be shown their deeds[3].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 99,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزَّلۡزَلَةِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zalzala",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Earthquake",
        "numberOfAyahs": 8,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 599,
      "ruku": 541,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6145,
      "text": "So whoever does an atom’s weight[4] of good will see it,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 99,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزَّلۡزَلَةِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zalzala",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Earthquake",
        "numberOfAyahs": 8,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 599,
      "ruku": 541,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6146,
      "text": "and whoever does an atom’s weight of evil will see it.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 99,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزَّلۡزَلَةِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zalzala",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Earthquake",
        "numberOfAyahs": 8,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 599,
      "ruku": 541,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6147,
      "text": "By the galloping, panting horses[1],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 100,
        "name": "سُورَةُ العَادِيَاتِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Aadiyaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Chargers",
